(7735138, 1275099, 114285, '<td valign="top">How do you keep those glasses on, beats me, amazing! Even though I''m pretty sure it''s not unique, still kudos for your effort. <br/> <br/>Oh and I love how it almost looks like he''s poking his tongue out. Would love to know how many takes you took.<br/> <br/>Ribbon for sure.</td>', 'How do you keep those glasses on, beats me, amazing! Even though I''m pretty sure it''s not unique, still kudos for your effort.  Oh and I love how it almost looks like he''s poking his tongue out. Would love to know how many takes you took. Ribbon for sure.', '2022-12-21 01:26:07.000000', NULL, 1),
(7735147, 1275099, 29535, '<td valign="top">Extra points for effort (and cleanup!) as well as a fun take on a shot you don''t see that often. Beautiful exposure too. Probably my number 1. Thanks for the inspiration!</td>', 'Extra points for effort (and cleanup!) as well as a fun take on a shot you don''t see that often. Beautiful exposure too. Probably my number 1. Thanks for the inspiration!', '2022-12-21 06:49:34.000000', NULL, 1),
(7735148, 1274942, 29535, '<td valign="top">I love this and have rated it highly. There are a handful of great studio/glass shots in this contest but this is the most colourful and original I reckon. Great job!</td>', 'I love this and have rated it highly. There are a handful of great studio/glass shots in this contest but this is the most colourful and original I reckon. Great job!', '2022-12-21 06:50:04.000000', NULL, 1),
(7735149, 1275098, 29535, '<td valign="top">One of two balloon burst shots both with great concepts, I love the amount effort this must have taken to get right. Great expression on the subject too!<br/> <br/>I''m curious how the burst was achieved :)</td>', 'One of two balloon burst shots both with great concepts, I love the amount effort this must have taken to get right. Great expression on the subject too! I''m curious how the burst was achieved :)', '2022-12-21 06:50:48.000000', NULL, 1),
(7735150, 1275035, 29535, '<td valign="top">Nice idea, great composition and perfectly composed. The little bit of napkin annoys me and could''ve been cloned out or masked but that''s nitpicking, a great result!</td>', 'Nice idea, great composition and perfectly composed. The little bit of napkin annoys me and could''ve been cloned out or masked but that''s nitpicking, a great result!', '2022-12-21 06:51:50.000000', NULL, 1),
(7735151, 1275103, 29535, '<td valign="top">I don''t usual rate abstract shots so highly but the wonderful colours and the variety of textures on show here along with the clear understanding of what''s being depicted make this a winner for me. Top five!</td>', 'I don''t usual rate abstract shots so highly but the wonderful colours and the variety of textures on show here along with the clear understanding of what''s being depicted make this a winner for me. Top five!', '2022-12-21 06:52:24.000000', NULL, 1),
(7735152, 1274990, 29535, '<td valign="top">Very simple, yet the lighting and composition is beautiful. Well done!</td>', 'Very simple, yet the lighting and composition is beautiful. Well done!', '2022-12-21 06:52:43.000000', NULL, 1),
(7735153, 1275094, 29535, '<td valign="top">I love the idea and the colour chosen. Good job!</td>', 'I love the idea and the colour chosen. Good job!', '2022-12-21 06:52:57.000000', NULL, 1),
(7735154, 1274992, 29535, '<td valign="top">What a great shot, good work on a difficult capture and great composition to boot!</td>', 'What a great shot, good work on a difficult capture and great composition to boot!', '2022-12-21 06:53:22.000000', NULL, 1),
(7735155, 1275069, 29535, '<td valign="top">This bird has some serious character! Wonderful colours and the perfect moment frozen in time. Love it!</td>', 'This bird has some serious character! Wonderful colours and the perfect moment frozen in time. Love it!', '2022-12-21 06:53:47.000000', NULL, 1),
(7735156, 1275054, 29535, '<td valign="top">I really love how the drops are positioned on this one. It''s a wonderful shot with some stiff competition. Good luck!</td>', 'I really love how the drops are positioned on this one. It''s a wonderful shot with some stiff competition. Good luck!', '2022-12-21 06:54:12.000000', NULL, 1),
(7735157, 1275025, 29535, '<td valign="top">This is a great spot, good moment to capture in difficult conditions. The composition isn''t perfect but the moment is, this crazy fella jogging in the rain and the clouds in the distance. A great candid shot. Well done!</td>', 'This is a great spot, good moment to capture in difficult conditions. The composition isn''t perfect but the moment is, this crazy fella jogging in the rain and the clouds in the distance. A great candid shot. Well done!', '2022-12-21 07:05:45.000000', NULL, 1),
(7735158, 1275004, 29535, '<td valign="top">Very cool colours in this one and a good job in getting that composition. Perhaps I''d like to see it a little wider but this is a great idea and a nice shot.</td>', 'Very cool colours in this one and a good job in getting that composition. Perhaps I''d like to see it a little wider but this is a great idea and a nice shot.', '2022-12-21 07:15:41.000000', NULL, 1),
(7735159, 1275050, 29535, '<td valign="top">Nice sunset and very cool seeing the water in all those individual droplets like that, perfect choice of shutter speed! Why''s he wearing a hat though ;)</td>', 'Nice sunset and very cool seeing the water in all those individual droplets like that, perfect choice of shutter speed! Why''s he wearing a hat though ;)', '2022-12-21 07:16:20.000000', NULL, 1),
(7735160, 1275106, 29535, '<td valign="top">Great moment to catch, wonderful bokeh and a good crop given the immediacy there must''ve been in taking and composing the shot! Nice job</td>', 'Great moment to catch, wonderful bokeh and a good crop given the immediacy there must''ve been in taking and composing the shot! Nice job', '2022-12-21 07:20:21.000000', NULL, 1),
(7735161, 1274980, 29535, '<td valign="top">This is a nice shot, well composed and some nice colours. Definitely one to revisit at different times of day to see what different conditions can bring to the shot.</td>', 'This is a nice shot, well composed and some nice colours. Definitely one to revisit at different times of day to see what different conditions can bring to the shot.', '2022-12-21 08:18:46.000000', NULL, 1),
(7735162, 1275002, 29535, '<td valign="top">Good creative shot, nice lighting and a good fit for the challenge. Well done!</td>', 'Good creative shot, nice lighting and a good fit for the challenge. Well done!', '2022-12-21 08:19:09.000000', NULL, 1),
(7735163, 1275093, 29535, '<td valign="top">It''s so difficult to shoot icicles, good job!</td>', 'It''s so difficult to shoot icicles, good job!', '2022-12-21 08:19:28.000000', NULL, 1),
