(7735359, 1275097, 29535, '<td valign="top">This is a great creative shot. I don''t know if I love enough about it subjectively to vote it among the best in this strong challenge, but I certainly appreciate the out of the box thinking and the variety it brings as well as the opportunities for future compositions it hints at. I wonder what can be achieved with different background lighting here?</td>', 'This is a great creative shot. I don''t know if I love enough about it subjectively to vote it among the best in this strong challenge, but I certainly appreciate the out of the box thinking and the variety it brings as well as the opportunities for future compositions it hints at. I wonder what can be achieved with different background lighting here?', '2022-12-23 07:46:09.000000', NULL, 1),
(7735360, 1275089, 29535, '<td valign="top">I love a good dram of Balvenie. I like that you''ve chosen this is a subject. I''m not 100% convinced on the choice of composition, but the colours and detail  are really good along with the lighting.</td>', 'I love a good dram of Balvenie. I like that you''ve chosen this is a subject. I''m not 100% convinced on the choice of composition, but the colours and detail  are really good along with the lighting.', '2022-12-23 07:47:19.000000', NULL, 1),
