(7735362, 1275102, 29535, '<td valign="top">Great job catching them in this diamond formation! It would''ve been perfect had there been the opportunity to get more directly above them but these shots are hard enough to come by to begin with let alone with perfect positioning. A great original image.</td>', 'Great job catching them in this diamond formation! It would''ve been perfect had there been the opportunity to get more directly above them but these shots are hard enough to come by to begin with let alone with perfect positioning. A great original image.', '2022-12-23 07:48:51.000000', NULL, 1),
